# Codex transport sync marker

Source: `packages/pi-codex-conversion/src/providers/openai-codex`
Reference revision: `3257c88472ef69797796ba14528ab4f86e6a029b`

This local seam keeps SSE headers, retry/recovery, SSE parsing, and blocked-prompt
diagnostics for client-executed Codex tools. Pi 0.84 owns the primary
openai-codex provider transport, Responses history/replay, WebSocket recovery,
session continuity, compaction hooks, diagnostics, and usage.
